<title>UK: Wuerttembergische Hypo sets 150 mln mark bond.</title>
<headline>Wuerttembergische Hypo sets 150 mln mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager GZB-Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WUERTTEMBERGISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK AG, STUTTGART</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN DEM   COUPON     *4.00     MATURITY    02.SEP.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.32    PAY DATE    02.SEP.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.35	DENOMS (K) 10	  SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO 02.SEP.98 THEN IF NOT CALLED AT PAR STEPS-UP</p>
<p>		 TO 4.75 PCT THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>		 OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 675</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
